{
  "id": "897",
  "title": "I Got Here by Bus 11",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2020-05-22",
  "synopsis": "How do you usually get around?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/897/2d6b3d06d823e91f571737f98936f3428c8f1095.mp3?1589701053",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我是坐11路公交车来的\n\n本：你是怎么来的？\n丽丽：我是坐11路公交车来的。\n本：这里没有11路公交车啊。\n丽丽：我的意思是说：我是走路来的。因为11路的“11”很像人的两条腿，所以在我们想开玩笑的时候，我们会把走路说成“坐11路公交车”。\n本：啊！我明白了。那如果我是跑步来的呢？\n丽丽：啊？这个我不知道。\n本：我可以说“我是坐11路快车来的”。",
    "traditional": "我是坐11路公交車來的\n\n本：你是怎麼來的？\n麗麗：我是坐11路公交車來的。\n本：這裡沒有11路公交車啊。\n麗麗：我的意思是說：我是走路來的。因為11路的“11”很像人的兩條腿，所以在我們想開玩笑的時候，我們會把走路說成“坐11路公交車”。\n本：啊！我明白了。那如果我是跑步來的呢？\n麗麗：啊？這個我不知道。\n本：我可以說“我是坐11路快車來的”。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I Got Here by Bus 11"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：你是怎么来的？",
      "traditional": "本：你是怎麼來的？",
      "pinyin": "běn nǐ shì zěn me lái de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: How did you get here?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我是坐11路公交车来的。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我是坐11路公交車來的。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ shì zuò 2 lù gōng jiāo chē lái de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: I got here by bus 11."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：这里没有11路公交车啊。",
      "traditional": "本：這裡沒有11路公交車啊。",
      "pinyin": "běn zhè lǐ méi yǒu 2 lù gōng jiāo chē á",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: There is no bus 11 here."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我的意思是说：我是走路来的。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我的意思是說：我是走路來的。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ de yì si shì shuō wǒ shì zǒu lù lái de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "因为11路的“11”很像人的两条腿，",
      "traditional": "因為11路的“11”很像人的兩條腿，",
      "pinyin": "yīn wèi 2 lù de 2 hěn xiàng rén de liǎng tiáo tuǐ",
      "english": "Lili: I meant to say: I got here by walking."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "所以在我们想开玩笑的时候，我们会把走路说成“坐11路公交车”。",
      "traditional": "所以在我們想開玩笑的時候，我們會把走路說成“坐11路公交車”。",
      "pinyin": "suǒ yǐ zài wǒ men xiǎng kāi wán xiào de shí hou wǒ men huì bǎ zǒu lù shuō chéng zuò 2 lù gōng jiāo chē",
      "english": "Because the “11” in bus 11 looks very similar to a pair of human legs."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "That’s the reason why when we are joking, we will refer to “walking” as “taking bus 11″."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "本：啊！我明白了。那如果我是跑步来的呢？",
      "traditional": "本：啊！我明白了。那如果我是跑步來的呢？",
      "pinyin": "běn a wǒ míng bai le nà rú guǒ wǒ shì pǎo bù lái de ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Ah! I understand. In that case, if I got here by running then?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "丽丽：啊？这个我不知道。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：啊？這個我不知道。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì á zhè ge wǒ bù zhī dào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Ah? I don’t know."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "本：我可以说“我是坐11路快车来的”。",
      "traditional": "本：我可以說“我是坐11路快車來的”。",
      "pinyin": "běn wǒ kě yǐ shuō wǒ shì zuò 2 lù kuài chē lái de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: I can say “I got here by express bus 11”."
    }
  ],
