      "I Got Here by Bus 11",
      "",
      "Ben: How did you get here?",
      "",
      "Lili: I got here by bus 11.",
      "",
      "Ben: There is no bus 11 here.",
      "",
      "Lili: I meant to say: I got here by walking.",
      "Because the “11” in bus 11 looks very similar to a pair of human legs.",
      "That’s the reason why when we are joking, we will refer to “walking” as “taking bus 11″.",
      "",
      "Ben: Ah! I understand. In that case, if I got here by running then?",
      "",
      "Lili: Ah? I don’t know.",
      "",
      "Ben: I can say “I got here by express bus 11”.",
      ""
